aligned}{R}^{2}{sin}^{2}⁡(ϕ)+{R}^{2}{cos}^{2}⁡(ϕ) & ={7}^{2}+{2}^{2} \\\\ {R}^{2}({sin}^{2}⁡(ϕ)+{cos}^{2}⁡(ϕ)) & =49+4 \\\\ {R}^{2} & =53 \\\\ R & =\\sqrt{53}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that we only consider the positive root since $R>0.$\n\nFinally, we can write the initial expression in amplitude-phase form as follows:\n\n$$\n2\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x)+7\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x)≈\\sqrt{53}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(x+1.292)\n$$" 13194139535123 true] [17592186332342 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332343 13194139535123 true] [17592186332342 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535123 true] [17592186332342 1041 "field-1" 13194139535123 true] [17592186332342 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332343 13194139535123 true] [17592186332342 1110 #uuid "8d87fb09-2a0c-529b-953a-1b72612e9822" 13194139535123 true] [17592186332343 1034 "\\sqrt{53}" 13194139535123 true] [17592186332343 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535123 true] [17592186332343 1111 #uuid "020dfe61-d022-5bb0-ab50-a9c632306a03" 13194139535123 true] [17592186332344 1000 #edb/ref 17592186332345 13194139535123 true] [17592186332344 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139535123 true] [17592186332344 1041 "field-2" 13194139535123 true] [17592186332344 1104 #edb/ref 17592186332345 13194139535123 true] [17592186332344 1110 #uuid "639419d8-f500-536b-8414-741be1b2f05e" 13194139535123 true] [17592186332345 1034 "1.292" 13194139535123 true] [17592186332345 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535123 true] [17592186332345 1111 #uuid "798ab3fa-9a8e-5ebd-a4fd-0eb92900724b" 13194139535123 true] [17592186332346 1017 #edb/ref 17592186332347 13194139535123 true] [17592186332346 1017 #edb/ref 17592186332350 13194139535123 true] [17592186332346 1089 "q-328001" 13194139535123 true] [17592186332346 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139535123 true] [17592186332346 1100 "Express $-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x$ in the form $R\\operatorname{cos}⁡(x+ϕ)$ with $ϕ\\in (0,{90}^{∘}).$\n\n$-3\\operatorname{sin}⁡x+3\\operatorname{cos}⁡x=$\n {{field-1}}\n$\\o